sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant FeedTimeline
    participant useFeedSubscription
    participant SubscriptionManager
    participant Relays
    participant EventCache
    participant FeedItem
    participant EventPublisher

    User->>FeedTimeline: Load Feed
    FeedTimeline->>useFeedSubscription: Subscribe to events
    useFeedSubscription->>EventCache: Check cache
    EventCache-->>useFeedSubscription: Return cached events
    useFeedSubscription->>SubscriptionManager: Subscribe to kind 1 events
    SubscriptionManager->>Relays: REQ subscription
    Relays-->>SubscriptionManager: EVENT responses
    SubscriptionManager-->>useFeedSubscription: Stream events
    useFeedSubscription->>EventCache: Cache new events
    useFeedSubscription-->>FeedTimeline: Update event list
    FeedTimeline->>FeedItem: Render events

    User->>FeedItem: Click like button
    FeedItem->>EventPublisher: Publish kind 7 reaction
    EventPublisher->>Relays: EVENT kind 7
    Relays-->>EventPublisher: OK response
    EventPublisher-->>FeedItem: Optimistic update
    FeedItem-->>User: Show liked state

    User->>FeedTimeline: Scroll down
    FeedTimeline->>useFeedSubscription: Request older events
    useFeedSubscription->>SubscriptionManager: Update since filter
    SubscriptionManager->>Relays: REQ with older timestamp
    Relays-->>SubscriptionManager: Older events
    SubscriptionManager-->>useFeedSubscription: Stream events
    useFeedSubscription-->>FeedTimeline: Append events
